            "review_title": "Review at Seoul Galbi",
            "review_text": "Jim W\n4 contributions\n0\nAbusive boss, avoid!\nDec 2022 • Solo\nI didn’t eat here, I want to make that clear up front. But I passed by and was curious as I love Korean bbq. The manager was out front BERATING his waitstaff, going on for several minutes shouting at the top of his lungs and making threatening physical gestures. His employees stood sullen, looking to be on the verge of tears. The conversation was conducted in Korean, but as anyone who has worked in a bar or restaurant can tell you if your employees aren’t performing up to expectations then that is a reflection on you as a manager NOT the quality of your waitstaff. Even if something bad had occurred you NEVER air dirty laundry in front of the customers and NEVER create a show for the few people who had chosen to eat there forcing them into an uncomfortable situation. \n\nAbusive management should never be rewarded,and this place deserves to fail on that alone. I hope his waitstaff quits on masse leaving him SOL. Abusing waitstaff should be a one-way ticket out of the industry. \n\nThe good news is that there are plenty of other options for Korean bbq in Saigon and anyone hankering for some galbi should look elsewhere.\nRead more\nWritten December 27, 2022",
            "rating": 4.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-10",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
